            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Sotomayor asked: \u201cHow could somebody have some success on the merits if they don't achieve a judgment of some sort?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "dcda670d3683c788004cd1fae808688d561770bcfbacb55f1d32322a6c979e53",
            "evidence_ids": [
